                <pb facs="0568" n="456" sameAs="frus:frus1910/pg456"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Ambassador Dudley to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Embassy</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Petropolis</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1910-05-18"><hi rendition="#italic">May 18,
                        1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Reference department’s May 15. Rio Branco to-day assented to proposed publication
                    of joint note in the three capitals. Publication here, though complete as a
                    Portuguese translation, may purport to be a résumé.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dudley.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
